  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday night through Friday) \nIssued at 200 AM MDT Sat Oct 31 2026\n\nAs the upper low pulls away from NM, precipitation will wane\nacross NE NM Monday night. Winds will also decrease through the\nevening, except across NE NM where gusty northerly winds will\npersist.  \n\nQuieter conditions expected Tuesday through Thursday as ridging\ninitially moves overhead Tuesday before becoming more zonal Wed\ninto Thur. Considerable uncertainty exists for Friday. Another\nstorm system may be in the offing, but models are very\ninconsistent regarding strength and timing of the system.",
